{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/"}],"@id":"papers/unital-groebner-bases/blocks/def-remainder-module","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Definition","doco:Section"],"label":"def:remainder-module","kind":"definition","title":"Remainder modules $O(I)$ and $\\tilde{O}(I)$","uses":["papers/unital-groebner-bases/blocks/def-admissible-system","papers/unital-groebner-bases/blocks/def-monomial-basis"],"tags":["groebner-basis","remainder","free-module"],"leanRef":"ugb:UGB.GrobnerShirshov.isNormalForm","text":"remainder-module.md","leanSource":"folio/unital-groebner-bases/unital-groebner-bases-chapter/remainder-module.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"def:remainder-module\"></a><p>Let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">R</code> be a commutative ring with unity, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">A</code> an <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">R</code>-algebra which\nis free as an <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">R</code>-module and without quasi-zeros, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(B, &#x3C;)</code> an\n<a href=\"#def:admissible-system\">admissible system</a> on <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">A</code>, and <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">I \\subseteq A</code>\na subset.</p>\n<p>Define the <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">R</code>-submodule <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">O(I)</code> of <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">A</code> — the <strong>remainder module</strong> — as the <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">R</code>-submodule spanned\nby the set</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  o(I) := \\bigl\\{\\lambda\\beta \\;\\big|\\;\n    \\lambda \\in R^*,\\; \\beta \\in B,\\;\n    \\forall\\, h \\in I\\colon \\mathrm{LT}(h) \\neq \\lambda\\beta\\bigr\\}.</code></pre>\n<p>Define also the <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">R</code>-module <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\tilde{O}(I)</code> as the <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">R</code>-submodule spanned\nby</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  \\tilde{o}(I) := B \\setminus \\{\\mathrm{LM}(h) \\mid h \\in I\\}.</code></pre>\n<p><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\tilde{O}(I)</code> is a free <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">R</code>-module.</p>\n","source":"folio/unital-groebner-bases/unital-groebner-bases-chapter/remainder-module.md","heading":"Definition","number":"2.2.5"}
